 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9zeACW6p1CUQ7kNvwGNdtKn&_nc_oc=Adl-g7JY_MORHFWtyNcJpmQefUKaLHWyy0Hqml9lcP-Lvy0lpkSrnpBwrcav656H2bo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxHOnfW3tBEovhjlbtHAs02eG6BVNdhn9BwNIRouBAGcA&oe=69B541B9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OnEOcLUgYcAQ7kNvwHcOWaT&_nc_oc=Adkd7at4TzmbmkG5B4hnOtw9RLgeJhcSxZb4GuJ9RCD0GH_tg6SN1MIR6xr2tSis0C4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxU17VU3QPvIHjhv0mxRguknpvQFljyWXezfXPJuUigPg&oe=69B55153"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LB6vkdYbjkwQ7kNvwE4aT24&_nc_oc=AdnHa5Sks_k9a_gXcu8Btwvnb34iq4Tx_vpo6WNO5Rp1M6X3TJTWPeAcBSCk1rJpl7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwmyCkIOTUNA6pW12yeSoTQchfvKkYptvwD5jyRvjx4sA&oe=69B55CFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mZt2jujFfJUQ7kNvwHa7Wmt&_nc_oc=AdlDuFd-Df5ebCowQWZ0dCXHZT1255eHRv6ENumQkoxFg0ChYf219bD2llrTisn7vog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx6vohuspipJwlvVCVSYE-h7QE3UXT4RfRopxpuNEEHIQ&oe=69B55E4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b72zF8AJ8-cQ7kNvwEBe8e4&_nc_oc=AdkTngeYJKhLG-LWfp0vBd_ozCAMP0PjD9xboELJ1dvSLflAJeT8f5TtuOWmdiCW3OU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwxX1_1fPw9-HvNtRxyFCG31s7Kgp--jQT0YtBA5JBYMQ&oe=69B5477E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp